                "id": 1,
                "text": "## v3.0 — GPT-5.1 Optimized\n\n**Model**: gpt-5.1 (400K context, 128K output)\n\n**GPT-5.1 Specific Settings**:\n- reasoning_effort: \"low\" (fast responses for content generation)\n- No temperature/top_p (fixed at 1 in GPT-5 series)\n- Adaptive reasoning automatically adjusts to task complexity\n\n**Key Features**:\n- Natural, human-sounding output (anti-AI detection)\n- GEO/LLM SEO for AI search engines (Google SGE, Perplexity, etc.)\n- Streamlined prompts optimized for GPT-5.1's instruction-following\n- ~60% smaller prompts than v1.0 (cost savings)\n- FAQ sections for featured snippet capture\n\n**GPT-5.1 Advantages**:\n- Better instruction adherence\n- More natural conversational style\n- Faster on simple tasks (adaptive reasoning)\n- 400K context window",
